WEBVTT

00:14:28.374 --> 00:14:30.592
than I see in a lot of workplaces.

00:14:31.225 --> 00:14:32.559
What's your take on that?

00:14:33.226 --> 00:14:36.378
DF: I think we were selling
cultural intervention.

00:14:36.402 --> 00:14:40.459
I think a culture is ultimately
the aggregates of the micro-actions

00:14:40.483 --> 00:14:41.963
that an organization takes,

00:14:41.987 --> 00:14:44.253
and we couldn't entirely control those.

00:14:44.932 --> 00:14:50.981
But I think we were trying
to help shape culture.

00:14:52.342 --> 00:14:56.419
The big learning for me was that space

00:14:56.443 --> 00:14:59.456
and the physical environment helped,

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.540
but at the end of the day it was the core